VALUES ('TOUR0307', 'Classic Sri Lanka Discovery', 'Experience the very best of Sri Lanka on this 10-day adventure through ancient cities, golden beaches, lush hills, and wildlife parks. From the historic wonders of Anuradhapura to the scenic train ride to Ella and the tropical beaches of Bentota, this journey captures the island’s soul  culture, nature, and relaxation in perfect harmony.', 'Cultural', 'Colombo', '', 10, 1000.00, 950.00, 'tour_6913197bc9c17.png', '[]', '[{\"day\":\"1\",\"title\":\"Arrival in Colombo\",\"description\":\"Arrive at Bandaranaike International Airport and meet your tour guide. Transfer to your hotel in Colombo and enjoy a short city tour covering Galle Face, Independence Square, and Pettah Market.\",\"accommodation\":\"Hotel Colombo\",\"meals\":\"Lunch,Dinner\"},{\"day\":\"2\",\"title\":\"Colombo To Anuradhapura\",\"description\":\"Travel to the ancient city of Anuradhapura. Explore UNESCO World Heritage sites like Ruwanwelisaya Stupa, Sri Maha Bodhi Tree, and the ancient royal palaces.\",\"accommodation\":\"Heritage Hotel, Anuradhapura\",\"meals\":\"Breakfast, Dinner\"},{\"day\":\"3\",\"title\":\"Wilpattu National Park Safari\",\"description\":\"Morning wildlife safari at Wilpattu National Park \\u2014 home to leopards, elephants, and exotic birds. Relax at the lodge in the evening.\",\"accommodation\":\"Safari Lodge, Wilpattu\",\"meals\":\"Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner\"},{\"day\":\"4\",\"title\":\"Anuradhapura To Trincomalee\",\"description\":\"Drive to Trincomalee and enjoy the beautiful Nilaveli Beach. Visit Koneswaram Temple and enjoy water activities or snorkeling.\",\"accommodation\":\"Beach Resort, Trincomalee\",\"meals\":\"breakfast,dinner\"},{\"day\":\"5\",\"title\":\"Trincomalee To Sigiriya\",\"description\":\"Head to the Cultural Triangle and climb the Sigiriya Lion Rock Fortress. Explore the surrounding gardens and enjoy views of the plains.\",\"accommodation\":\"Resort Hotel, Sigiriya\",\"meals\":\"Breakfast, Dinner\"},{\"day\":\"6\",\"title\":\"Dambulla To Kandy\",\"description\":\"Visit the Dambulla Cave Temple and drive to Kandy \\u2014 the last royal capital. In the evening, enjoy the Temple of the Tooth Relic and a cultural dance show.\",\"accommodation\":\"Hilltop Hotel, Kandy\",\"meals\":\"Breakfast, Dinner\"},{\"day\":\"7\",\"title\":\"Kandy To Ella\",\"description\":\"Take the famous scenic train ride from Kandy to Ella \\u2014 one of the most beautiful train journeys in the world. Enjoy views of tea plantations and waterfalls.\",\"accommodation\":\"Mountain View Hotel, Ella\",\"meals\":\"Breakfast, Dinner\"},{\"day\":\"8\",\"title\":\"Ella To Galle\",\"description\":\"Explore Nine Arches Bridge and Rawana Falls before heading south to Galle. Walk around Galle Fort and enjoy the sunset by the coast.\",\"accommodation\":\"Colonial Hotel, Galle\",\"meals\":\"Breakfast, Dinner\"},{\"day\":\"9\",\"title\":\"Galle To Bentota\",\"description\":\"Relax by the beach in Bentota. Optional boat safari on the Madu River or visit a turtle hatchery.\",\"accommodation\":\"Beach Resort, Bentota\",\"meals\":\"Breakfast, Dinner\"},{\"day\":\"10\",\"title\":\"Bentota To Airport\",\"description\":\"After breakfast, transfer to Bandaranaike International Airport for departure. End of your memorable Sri Lanka journey.\",\"accommodation\":\"\",\"meals\":\"Breakfast\"}]', '[]', '[]', 'active', 1, 369);
VALUES ('TOUR9110', 'Anuradhapura City tour', '🏛️ Anuradhapura: Ancient Kings & Sacred Wonders (1-Day Tour)Duration: 8 Hours | Type: Cultural & Heritage City Tour |\r\n\r\nHighlights: UNESCO World Heritage Site, Buddhist Pilgrimage, Ancient Engineering\r\n\r\n🌟 Tour Overview: Step Back 2,000 YearsJourney to the heart of Sri Lankan history in Anuradhapura, the island\'s first ancient capital and a UNESCO World Heritage Site. This immersive 8-hour tour is meticulously designed to cover the most sacred and architecturally significant sites, offering a profound glimpse into a civilization that flourished for over a millennium.\r\nWitness the majestic stupas, marvel at ancient hydraulic engineering, and stand beneath the world\'s oldest historically documented tree. Prepare for a day of serenity, awe, and deep cultural discovery.\r\n\r\n🗺️ What You Will Experience (The Itinerary Highlights)\r\n\r\nYour 8-hour journey will focus on the Atamasthana (Eight Sacred Places) and other key historical marvels, ensuring you experience the spiritual and architectural best of the ancient city.\r\n\r\n- Jaya Sri Maha Bodhi\r\n\r\nPay homage to the oldest living, documented tree in the world, grown from a sapling of the original Bodhi Tree under which the Buddha attained enlightenment. A powerful spiritual experience.\r\n\r\n- Ruwanwelisaya Stupa\r\n\r\nStand before the magnificent, brilliant-white stupa, one of the most sacred Buddhist monuments. Marvel at the surrounding wall guarded by hundreds of carved elephants.\r\n\r\n- Thuparamaya & Mirisawetiya\r\n\r\nVisit the site of the first stupa built in Sri Lanka, and explore Mirisawetiya, a testament to royal devotion and history.\r\n\r\n- Jetavanaramaya & Abhayagiri Stupa\r\n\r\nWitness the colossal scale of these brick monuments, which were once among the tallest structures in the ancient world, showcasing unparalleled construction skills.\r\n\r\n- Kuttam Pokuna (Twin Ponds)\r\n\r\nAdmire this engineering masterpiece—an intricate bathing complex that demonstrates the advanced hydraulic knowledge of the ancient Sinhalese civilization.\r\n\r\n- Isurumuniya Temple\r\n\r\nA beautiful rock temple known for its serene atmosphere and exquisite stone carvings, most famously the \'Isurumuniya Lovers\'. Climb the rock for a panoramic view of the ancient city.\r\n\r\n- Samadhi Statue\r\n\r\nContemplate the serenity of this masterpiece of ancient sculpture, depicting the Buddha in a state of deep meditation.\r\n\r\n✨ Why Choose Our Anuradhapura Tour?\r\n\r\nMaximum Immersion in 8 Hours: Our expertly planned itinerary prioritizes the most significant sites, maximizing your time without feeling rushed.\r\n\r\nDeep Cultural Context: Our guides are trained to bring the ruins to life with fascinating stories of kings, monks, and the flourishing civilization that shaped Sri Lanka.\r\n\r\nSeamless Logistics: Travel comfortably and efficiently between the sprawling archaeological sites, ensuring a smooth and stress-free day.\r\n\r\n📝 Important Notes\r\nDress Code: As a sacred city, modest attire is required. Please ensure shoulders and knees are covered. Hats and shoes must be removed before entering the temple precincts.\r\n\r\nSun & Heat: Anuradhapura can be hot. We strongly recommend bringing a hat, sunscreen, and plenty of water. Starting the tour early is advisable to beat the mid-day heat.\r\n\r\nReady to walk through the grand history of Sri Lanka? Book your day tour today and discover the spiritual heart of the island!', 'Adventure', '', 'Anuradhapura / Mihinthale', 1, 39.00, NULL, 'tour_1773666592_69b80120d0234.webp', '["gallery_69295226e09d2.jpeg","gallery_69295226e31fe.jpeg","gallery_69295226e490c.jpeg","gallery_69295226e75c2.jpeg","gallery_69295226e99ad.jpeg","gallery_69295226ec87a.jpeg","gallery_69295226edb70.jpeg","gallery_69295226ef878.jpeg","gallery_69295226f2799.jpeg","gallery_69295226f3cbe.jpeg","gallery_6929522701007.jpeg","gallery_69295227028f1.jpeg","gallery_6929522703e67.jpeg","gallery_6929522705689.jpeg","gallery_6929522706f78.jpeg","gallery_6929522708292.jpeg","gallery_692952270989f.jpeg","gallery_692952270ad10.jpeg","gallery_692952270becb.jpeg","gallery_692952270d1fd.jpeg"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'active', 0, 398);
VALUES ('TOUR9131', 'Colombo City Tour', 'Colombo: The Capital City\'s Vibrant Heart (1-Day Tour)\r\n\r\nDuration: 8 Hours | Type: Urban, Cultural, & Architectural Discovery | Highlights: Colonial History, Modern Cityscape, Religious Diversity, Local Markets\r\n\r\n🌟 Tour Overview: A Kaleidoscope of Old and New\r\nExperience the fascinating contrasts of Colombo, a city where 17th-century colonial architecture stands proudly beside sleek, modern high-rises. Our comprehensive 8-hour tour is a journey through time, blending spiritual serenity with the energetic hustle of commerce and life.\r\n\r\nFrom the tranquil waters of Beira Lake to the sensory overload of Pettah Market and the historic elegance of the Fort district, you will see exactly how Colombo has evolved into the dynamic South Asian hub it is today.\r\n\r\n🗺️ What You Will Experience (The Itinerary Highlights)\r\nWe have carefully curated an itinerary that minimizes travel time and maximizes your exposure to Colombo\'s most iconic and culturally rich sites.\r\n\r\n- Gangaramaya Temple\r\n\r\nA unique, eclectic Buddhist temple complex that is part museum, part shrine, and part educational center, reflecting Sri Lanka\'s rich religious heritage.\r\n\r\n- Seema Malaka (Floating Temple)\r\n\r\nLocated on Beira Lake, this stunning, tranquil temple was designed by the famous architect Geoffrey Bawa—a perfect place for quiet reflection amidst the city noise.\r\n\r\n- National Museum of Colombo\r\n\r\nThe largest museum in Sri Lanka, offering a deep dive into the island\'s history, culture, and ancient royal artifacts.\r\n\r\n- Independence Memorial Hall\r\n\r\nA magnificent stone monument commemorating Sri Lanka\'s freedom from British rule, set in the greenery of Independence Square.\r\n\r\n- Viharamahadevi Park\r\n\r\nA brief drive-through or stop at Colombo\'s largest and oldest park, renowned for its golden Buddha statue and peaceful atmosphere.\r\n\r\n- Jami Ul-Alfar Mosque (Red Mosque)\r\n\r\nAn architectural marvel in the Pettah district, famous for its striking red and white striped façade and unique Indo-Saracenic style.\r\n\r\n- Pettah Market\r\n\r\nDive into the vibrant, chaotic heart of Colombo’s commerce. Experience a true sensory adventure exploring streets dedicated to spices, textiles, jewelry, and fresh produce.\r\n\r\n- Colombo Lotus Tower\r\n\r\nThe tallest self-supported structure in South Asia, offering restaurants and an observation deck.\r\n\r\n- Sri Kailawasanathan Swami Devasthanam Kovil\r\n\r\nAn important, ornate kovil (temple) that showcases vibrant Dravidian architecture.\r\n\r\n- Gem Museum\r\n\r\nA dedicated location to learn about and view Sri Lanka\'s famous precious gemstones.\r\n\r\n- Independence Square\r\n\r\nThe location of the Independence Memorial Hall and surrounding leisure space, great for a historical stop.\r\n\r\n✨ Why Choose Our Colombo Tour?\r\nDiverse Experience: This tour perfectly balances spirituality, history, modern life, and local market culture in a single day.\r\n\r\nLogistical Efficiency: We navigate Colombo\'s busy streets efficiently to ensure you spend more time sightseeing and less time in traffic.\r\n\r\nCultural Immersion: Get an authentic taste of local life, from the street food at Galle Face Green to the vibrant chaos of Pettah.\r\n\r\nReady to explore the beautiful chaos and charm of Colombo? Book your 8-hour city tour now!', 'Adventure', '', 'Colombo City', 1, 39.00, NULL, 'tour_1773666269_69b7ffdda92c7.webp', '["gallery_6929584a6b01a.jpeg","gallery_6929584a6d7a0.jpeg","gallery_6929584a6f881.jpeg","gallery_6929584a736d8.jpeg","gallery_6929584a76019.jpeg","gallery_6929584a78ab9.jpeg","gallery_6929584a7b8c0.jpeg","gallery_6929584a7d751.jpeg","gallery_6929584a7eaac.jpeg","gallery_6929584a83f0e.jpeg","gallery_6929584a8dd9c.jpeg","gallery_6929584a8f57c.jpeg","gallery_6929584a9033f.jpeg","gallery_6929584a9388e.jpeg","gallery_6929584a955d6.jpeg","gallery_6929584a9622e.jpeg","gallery_6929584a9771c.jpeg","gallery_6929584a98a7b.jpeg","gallery_6929584a99aa8.jpeg","gallery_6929584a9ba92.jpeg"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'active', 0, 408);

